{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》昨晚（12日）播出的一集，「關子盈」陳自瑤飾接連被「好姊妹」背叛，先是被「菲雅」傅嘉莉公報私仇連摑十幾巴，其後再被「鳳儀」姚子羚與「安安」鄺潔楹設局落藥陪VIP客戶，今集陳自瑤的演出精湛，獲觀眾大讚虐心指數爆燈！</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.282292+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.645415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.645415+00:00","content_hash":"30194f46c114138cebb7576367cca8b709611ee0100b5dc7e80114db3fb0303c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}